OL,3,GNEWSAFire engulfs Bermondsey waste
OL,4,Acentre
OL,5,
OL,6,FAbout 100 firefighters are tackling a
OL,7,Fmassive blaze at a waste facility in
OL,8,Fsouth-east London.
OL,10,FFifteen fire engines were called to
OL,11,FLandmann Way in Bermondsey shortly
OL,12,Fbefore 20:00 BST after about 50 tonnes
OL,13,Fof household waste caught fire.
OL,15,FLondon Fire Brigade (LFB) warned that a
OL,16,Flarge amount of smoke was being
OL,17,Fproduced by the blaze and advised local
OL,18,Fresidents to keep their doors and
OL,19,Fwindows closed.
OL,23,APub: 18-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,324,320,200,140,0,100
