OL,3,GNEWSAFire engulfs Bermondsey waste
OL,4,Acentre
OL,5,
OL,6,FLFB said the cause of the fire was not
OL,7,Fyet known, but firefighters tackled a
OL,8,Fblaze at the same facility in June.
